                </p>
                <p>
                    tiru-malai-nāṭṭu-t tiru-k-koṭuṅ
                    <lb n="3" break="no"/>-kuṉṟattu Uṭaiyār tiru-k-koṭuṅ-kuṉṟam-uṭaiya nāyaṉāṟku t <gap reason="lost" quantity="4" unit="character" precision="low"/> valil paratēci A
